      hook: 'Do what (performance), given what (conditions), how well (criterion)?',
      exam: 'Find the parts in a sentence. “Given …” is the condition; the observable verb is the performance; the standard (“with no errors,” “at least three”) is the criterion. ATD’s tool calls them the action, performance condition, and performance criterion statements.',
